nu\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><svg class=\"w-6 h-6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16\"></path></svg></button></div></header><main id=\"main-content\" class=\"pt-16\"><section class=\"relative bg-navy min-h-[90vh] flex items-center overflow-hidden scanlines\"><svg class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none \" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"opacity:0.12\"><defs><pattern id=\"circuit-grid\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"80\" y2=\"40\" stroke=\"#00ACC1\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"></line><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"80\" y2=\"0\" stroke=\"#00796B\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"></line><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"80\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#00796B\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"></line><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"40\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#00ACC1\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"></line><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#00796B\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"></line><line x1=\"80\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"80\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#00796B\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"></line><circle cx=\"40\" cy=\"40\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#00ACC1\"></circle><circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" r=\"1.5\" fill=\"#00796B\"></circle><circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"0\" r=\"1.5\" fill=\"#00796B\"></circle><circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"80\" r=\"1.5\" fill=\"#00796B\"></circle><circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"80\" r=\"1.5\" fill=\"#00796B\"></circle><circle cx=\"40\" cy=\"0\" r=\"1\" fill=\"#00ACC1\"></circle><circle cx=\"40\" cy=\"80\" r=\"1\" fill=\"#00ACC1\"></circle><circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"40\" r=\"1\" fill=\"#00ACC1\"></circle><circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"40\" r=\"1\" fill=\"#00ACC1\"></circle><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"40\" y2=\"40\" stroke=\"#00ACC1\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"></line><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"40\" y2=\"40\" stroke=\"#00ACC1\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"></line><line x1=\"55\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"65\" y2=\"40\" stroke=\"#00796B\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"></line><line x1=\"65\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"65\" y2=\"40\" stroke=\"#00796B\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"></line><circle cx=\"65\" cy=\"40\" r=\"1.5\" fill=\"#00796B\"></circle><circle cx=\"65\" cy=\"30\" r=\"1.5\" fill=\"#00796B\"></circle><line x1=\"15\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"25\" y2=\"40\" stroke=\"#00796B\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"></line><line x1=\"15\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"15\" y2=\"50\" stroke=\"#00796B\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"></line><circle cx=\"15\" cy=\"40\" r=\"1.5\" fill=\"#00796B\"></circle><circle cx=\"15\" cy=\"50\" r=\"1.5\" fill=\"#00796B\"></circle></pattern></defs><rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"url(#circuit-grid)\"></rect></svg><div class=\"absolute top-1/4 left-1/4 w-96 h-96 bg-teal/10 rounded-full blur-[120px] pointer-events-none\"></div><div class=\"absolute bottom-1/4 right-1/4 w-64 h-64 bg-teal-lt/5 rounded-full blur-[100px] pointer-events-none\"></div><div class=\"relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-24 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center\"><div><p class=\"section-label mb-4\">// AITRUSTAUDIT.COM</p><h1 class=\"font-display text-white text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-black leading-tight mb-6 text-glow\">Is Your AI Stack a Security Liability?</h1><p class=\"font-body text-teal-lt text-xl mb-8 leading-relaxed\">AITrustAudit.com is the practitioner’s resource for AI security auditing — built for the professionals who have to actually do the work.</p><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4\"><a href=\"https://calendly.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-teal hover:bg-teal-lt text-white font-display font-bold text-sm px-7 py-4 rounded-lg tracking-wide transition-all duration-200 shadow-lg shadow-teal/30 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal-lt focus:ring-offset-2 focus:ring-offset-navy\">Book a Free Discovery Call</a><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center border border-teal-lt/50 hover:border-teal-lt text-teal-lt hover:text-white font-display font-bold text-sm px-7 py-4 rounded-lg tracking-wide transition-all duration-200 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal-lt focus:ring-offset-2 focus:ring-offset-navy\" href=\"/free-risk-overview\">Download Free Risk Overview</a></div></div><div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center justify-center\"><div class=\"relative w-64 h-64\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-teal/10 rounded-full blur-3xl\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center\"><svg width=\"96\" height=\"96\" viewBox=\"0 0 96 96\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"filter:drop-shadow(0 0 12px rgba(0,200,255,0.6))\"><path d=\"M48 8 L82 22 L82 52 C82 68 66 82 48 88 C30 82 14 68 14 52 L14 22 Z\" stroke=\"#00ACC1\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" fill=\"#0D1B2A\"></path><path d=\"M48 16 L74 28 L74 52 C74 64 62 75 48 80 C34 75 22 64 22 52 L22 28 Z\" fill=\"#00796B\" opacity=\"0.25\"></path><text x=\"48\" y=\"58\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Orbitron, sans-serif\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#00ACC1\" letter-spacing=\"2\">AI</text><circle cx=\"48\" cy=\"8\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#00ACC1\"></circle><circle cx=\"82\" cy=\"22\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#00796B\"></circle><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"22\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#00796B\"></circle></svg></div><svg class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><line x1=\"128\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"128\" y2=\"56\" stroke=\"#00ACC1\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\"0.5\"></line><line x1=\"128\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"128\" y2=\"256\" stroke=\"#00ACC1\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\"0.5\"></line><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"128\" x2=\"56\" y2=\"128\" stroke=\"#00ACC1\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\"0.5\"></line><line x1=\"200\" y1=\"128\" x2=\"256\" y2=\"128\" stroke=\"#00ACC1\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\"0.5\"></line><circle cx=\"128\" cy=\"0\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#00ACC1\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle><circle cx=\"128\" cy=\"256\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#00ACC1\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle><circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"128\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#00ACC1\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle><circle cx=\"256\" cy=\"128\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#00ACC1\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle></svg></div></div></div></section><div class=\"bg-navy py-10 px-4 w-full\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 text-center\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-1\"><span class=\"font-display text-teal-lt text-glow text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black\">80%</span><span class=\"font-body text-xs md:text-sm text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold max-w-[140px] leading-tight\">of AI data leaks come from inside the organization</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-1\"><span class=\"font-display text-teal-lt text-glow text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black\">73%</span><span class=\"font-body text-xs md:text-sm text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold max-w-[140px] leading-tight\">of SMBs have zero AI security policy</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-1\"><span class=\"font-display text-teal-lt text-glow text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black\">$4.9M</span><span class=\"font-body text-xs md:text-sm text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold max-w-[140px] leading-tight\">average cost of an AI-related breach</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-1\"><span class=\"font-display text-teal-lt text-glow text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black\">$499</span><span class=\"font-body text-xs md:text-sm text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold max-w-[140px] leading-tight\">starting price for a full audit report</span></div></div></div><section class=\"bg-light-bg py-20 px-4\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12\"><p class=\"section-label mb-3\">// WHAT WE FIX</p><h2 class=\"font-display text-navy text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4\">The 5 AI Security Risks Threatening Your Business</h2><p class=\"font-body text-mid-gray text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto\">80% of unauthorized AI activity comes from inside your organization. Here’s what you’re almost certainly dealing with right now.</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\"><div class=\"relative bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md border border-divider overflow-hidden hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow duration-200\" style=\"border-left:4px solid #B71C1C\"><div class=\"p-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-3\"><span class=\"text-xs font-display font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full badge-critical\" style=\"letter-spacing:0.08em\">CRITICAL</span><span class=\"text-3xl font-display font-black text-divider\">0<!-- -->1</span></div><h3 class=\"font-display text-navy text-base font-bold mb-2 leading-tight\">Shadow AI: The Invisible Attack Surface</h3><p class=\"text-mid-gray text-sm mb-4 font-body leading-relaxed\">Your employees are using ChatGPT, Claude, and dozens of other AI tools you never approved. Each one is a potential data exfiltration channel you can&#x27;t see, can&#x27;t audit, and definitely can&#x27;t remediate.</p><div class=\"rounded-md p-3 text-sm font-body font-semibold\" style=\"background:#B71C1C18;color:#B71C1C;border-left:3px solid #B71C1C\">How many AI tools is your team using right now — and how many do you actually know about?</div></div></div><div class=\"relative bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md border border-divider overflow-hidden hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow duration-200\" style=\"border-left:4px solid #E65100\"><div class=\"p-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-3\"><span class=\"text-xs font-display font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full badge-high\" style=\"letter-spacing:0.08em\">HIGH</span><span class=\"text-3xl font-display font-black text-divider\">0<!-- -->2</span></div><h3 class=\"font-display text-navy text-base font-bold mb-2 leading-tight\">Client Data in AI Training Pipelines</h3><p class=\"text-mid-gray text-sm mb-4 font-body leading-relaxed\">When your team pastes client files, contracts, or PII into AI tools, that data may be used to train the model. You just handed a third party your most sensitive assets with zero contractual protection.</p><div class=\"rounded-md p-3 text-sm font-body font-semibold\" style=\"background:#E6510018;color:#E65100;border-left:3px solid #E65100\">Are your employees inadvertently training AI models on client data without consent?</div></div></div><div class=\"relative bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md border border-divider overflow-hidden hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow duration-200\" style=\"border-left:4px solid #E65100\"><div class=\"p-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-3\"><span class=\"text-xs font-display font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full badge-high\" style=\"letter-spacing:0.08em\">HIGH</span><span class=\"text-3xl font-display font-black text-divider\">0<!-- -->3</span></div><h3 class=\"font-display text-navy text-base font-bold mb-2 leading-tight\">No AI Acceptable Use Policy</h3><p class=\"text-mid-gray text-sm mb-4 font-body leading-relaxed\">73% of SMBs have no written policy governing AI use. No policy means no accountability, no limits, and no defense when something goes wrong. It also means your cyber insurance claim might get denied.</p><div class=\"rounded-md p-3 text-sm font-body font-semibold\" style=\"background:#E6510018;color:#E65100;border-left:3px solid #E65100\">What happens legally if an employee&#x27;s AI use causes a data breach and you have no policy?</div></div></div><div class=\"relative bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md border border-divider overflow-hidden hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow duration-200\" style=\"border-left:4px solid #E65100\"><div class=\"p-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-3\"><span class=\"text-xs font-display font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full badge-high\" style=\"letter-spacing:0.08em\">HIGH</span><span class=\"text-3xl font-display font-black text-divider\">0<!-- -->4</span></div><h3 class=\"font-display text-navy text-base font-bold mb-2 leading-tight\">Compliance Exposure (HIPAA, GDPR, SOC 2)</h3><p class=\"text-mid-gray text-sm mb-4 font-body leading-relaxed\">AI tools break existing compliance frameworks in ways your current controls don&#x27;t catch. HIPAA covered entities using AI without a BAA. GDPR-subject data flowing to non-compliant LLM providers. SOC 2 scopes that don&#x27;t cover AI systems.</p><div class=\"rounded-md p-3 text-sm font-body font-semibold\" style=\"background:#E6510018;color:#E65100;border-left:3px solid #E65100\">Have you mapped your AI tool stack against your specific compliance obligations?</div></div></div><div class=\"relative bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md border border-divider overflow-hidden hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow duration-200\" style=\"border-left:4px solid #00ACC1\"><div class=\"p-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-3\"><span class=\"text-xs font-display font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full badge-medium\" style=\"letter-spacing:0.08em\">MEDIUM</span><span class=\"text-3xl font-display font-black text-divider\">0<!-- -->5</span></div><h3 class=\"font-display text-navy text-base font-bold mb-2 leading-tight\">Unchecked AI Vendor &amp; Third-Party Risk</h3><p class=\"text-mid-gray text-sm mb-4 font-body leading-relaxed\">Every AI vendor in your stack is a potential supply chain risk. Most SMBs have never reviewed an AI vendor&#x27;s security posture, data retention policy, or incident response plan.</p><div class=\"rounded-md p-3 text-sm font-body font-semibold\" style=\"background:#00ACC118;color:#00ACC1;border-left:3px solid #00ACC1\">Who reviewed the security posture of the last AI tool your team adopted?</div></div></div><div class=\"md:col-span-2 lg:col-span-3 bg-navy rounded-lg p-6 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 border border-teal/30\"><div><p class=\"font-display text-teal-lt text-sm font-bold mb-1\">READY TO SEE YOUR ACTUAL EXPOSURE?</p><p class=\"font-body text-gray-300\">A professional audit report tells you exactly which of these risks apply to your stack — and what to do about them.</p></div><a href=\"https://calendly.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"shrink-0 bg-teal hover:bg-teal-lt text-white font-display font-bold text-sm px-6 py-3 rounded-lg tracking-wide transition-colors whitespace-nowrap focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal-lt\">Book a Free Discovery Call</a></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-white py-20 px-4\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12\"><p class=\"section-label mb-3\">// WHO THIS IS FOR</p><h2 class=\"font-display text-navy text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold\">Built for the Professional Who Has to Do the Work</h2></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6\"><div class=\"relative bg-navy rounded-xl p-8 overflow-hidden hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-teal/10 transition-shadow\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-1 bg-teal opacity-60\"></div><div class=\"text-4xl mb-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🔒</div><h3 class=\"font-display text-teal-lt text-lg font-bold mb-3\">Security Practitioners</h3><p class=\"font-body text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed\">AI just rewrote the threat model. If you can&#x27;t speak fluently to AI risk — shadow AI, LLM prompt injection, model poisoning — you&#x27;re behind. This site gives you the frameworks and practitioner vocabulary to catch up fast.</p></div><div class=\"relative bg-navy rounded-xl p-8 overflow-hidden hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-teal/10 transition-shadow\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-1 bg-teal opacity-60\"></div><div class=\"text-4xl mb-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\">📋</div><h3 class=\"font-display text-teal-lt text-lg font-bold mb-3\">Compliance &amp; GRC Teams</h3><p class=\"font-body text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed\">AI broke your existing frameworks before you had a chance to adapt. NIST CSF doesn&#x27;t cover LLMs. ISO 27001 doesn&#x27;t address training data. This is where you get AI-specific compliance mapping built for the work you actually have to do.</p></div><div class=\"relative bg-navy rounded-xl p-8 overflow-hidden hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-teal/10 transition-shadow\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-1 bg-teal opacity-60\"></div><div class=\"text-4xl mb-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🏢</div><h3 class=\"font-display text-teal-lt text-lg font-bold mb-3\">SMB Operators</h3><p class=\"font-body text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed\">You&#x27;re using Copilot, ChatGPT, and half a dozen other AI tools across your team. Nobody approved them. Nobody audited them. Nobody knows what data they&#x27;re ingesting. That&#x27;s not a technology problem — it&#x27;s a liability problem. Let&#x27;s fix it.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-teal py-16 px-4\"><div class=\"max-w-5xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 items-center\"><div><p class=\"section-label text-white/70 mb-3\">// FREE RESOURCE</p><h2 class=\"font-display text-white text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mb-4 leading-tight\">Start Here: Free AI Security Risk Overview</h2><p class=\"font-body text-teal-bg text-lg mb-6\">Know exactly where your risks are. Zero cost. No sales call required. Used by 500+ security professionals to brief SMB leadership.</p><form class=\"space-y-3\"><div class=\"flex gap-3\"><input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"First name\" class=\"w-1/3 px-4 py-3 rounded-lg bg-white/10 border border-white/30 text-white placeholder-white/50 font-body text-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-white\" value=\"\"/><input type=\"email\" required=\"\" placeholder=\"Email address\" class=\"flex-1 px-4 py-3 rounded-lg bg-white/10 border border-white/30 text-white placeholder-white/50 font-body text-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-white\" value=\"\"/></div><button type=\"submit\" class=\"w-full bg-navy hover:bg-navy/80 text-teal-lt font-display font-bold text-sm py-3 rounded-lg tra