.9M\",\"label\":\"average cost of an AI-related breach\"},{\"stat\":\"$$499\",\"label\":\"starting price for a full audit report\"}]}]\na:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-light-bg py-20 px-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"max-w-7xl mx-auto\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-center mb-12\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"section-label mb-3\",\"children\":\"// WHAT WE FIX\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"font-display text-navy text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4\",\"children\":\"The 5 AI Security Risks Threatening Your Business\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-mid-gray text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto\",\"children\":\"80% of unauthorized AI activity comes from inside your organization. Here’s what you’re almost certainly dealing with right now.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"$L15\",\"1\",{\"severity\":\"critical\",\"number\":1,\"title\":\"Shadow AI: The Invisible Attack Surface\",\"description\":\"Your employees are using ChatGPT, Claude, and dozens of other AI tools you never approved. Each one is a potential data exfiltration channel you can't see, can't audit, and definitely can't remediate.\",\"question\":\"How many AI tools is your team using right now — and how many do you actually know about?\"}],[\"$\",\"$L15\",\"2\",{\"severity\":\"high\",\"number\":2,\"title\":\"Client Data in AI Training Pipelines\",\"description\":\"When your team pastes client files, contracts, or PII into AI tools, that data may be used to train the model. You just handed a third party your most sensitive assets with zero contractual protection.\",\"question\":\"Are your employees inadvertently training AI models on client data without consent?\"}],[\"$\",\"$L15\",\"3\",{\"severity\":\"high\",\"number\":3,\"title\":\"No AI Acceptable Use Policy\",\"description\":\"73% of SMBs have no written policy governing AI use. No policy means no accountability, no limits, and no defense when something goes wrong. It also means your cyber insurance claim might get denied.\",\"question\":\"What happens legally if an employee's AI use causes a data breach and you have no policy?\"}],[\"$\",\"$L15\",\"4\",{\"severity\":\"high\",\"number\":4,\"title\":\"Compliance Exposure (HIPAA, GDPR, SOC 2)\",\"description\":\"AI tools break existing compliance frameworks in ways your current controls don't catch. HIPAA covered entities using AI without a BAA. GDPR-subject data flowing to non-compliant LLM providers. SOC 2 scopes that don't cover AI systems.\",\"question\":\"Have you mapped your AI tool stack against your specific compliance obligations?\"}],[\"$\",\"$L15\",\"5\",{\"severity\":\"medium\",\"number\":5,\"title\":\"Unchecked AI Vendor & Third-Party Risk\",\"description\":\"Every AI vendor in your stack is a potential supply chain risk. Most SMBs have never reviewed an AI vendor's security posture, data retention policy, or incident response plan.\",\"question\":\"Who reviewed the security posture of the last AI tool your team adopted?\"}]],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"md:col-span-2 lg:col-span-3 bg-navy rounded-lg p-6 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 border border-teal/30\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-display text-teal-lt text-sm font-bold mb-1\",\"children\":\"READY TO SEE YOUR ACTUAL EXPOSURE?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-gray-300\",\"children\":\"A professional audit report tells you exactly which of these risks apply to your stack — and what to do about them.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://calendly.com\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"className\":\"shrink-0 bg-teal hover:bg-teal-lt text-white font-display font-bold text-sm px-6 py-3 rounded-lg tracking-wide transition-colors whitespace-nowrap focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal-lt\",\"children\":\"Book a Free Discovery Call\"}]]}]]}]]}]}]\nb:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-white py-20 px-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"max-w-7xl mx-auto\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-center mb-12\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"section-label mb-3\",\"children\":\"// WHO THIS IS FOR\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"font-display text-navy text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold\",\"children\":\"Built for the Professional Who Has to Do the Work\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",\"Security Practitioners\",{\"className\":\"relative bg-navy rounded-xl p-8 overflow-hidden hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-teal/10 transition-shadow\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-1 bg-teal opacity-60\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-4xl mb-4\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":\"🔒\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"font-display text-teal-lt text-lg font-bold mb-3\",\"children\":\"Security Practitioners\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"AI just rewrote the threat model. If you can't speak fluently to AI risk — shadow AI, LLM prompt injection, model poisoning — you're behind. This site gives you the frameworks and practitioner vocabulary to catch up fast.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"Compliance & GRC Teams\",{\"className\":\"relative bg-navy rounded-xl p-8 overflow-hidden hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-teal/10 transition-shadow\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-1 bg-teal opacity-60\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-4xl mb-4\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":\"📋\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"font-display text-teal-lt text-lg font-bold mb-3\",\"children\":\"Compliance & GRC Teams\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"AI broke your existing frameworks before you had a chance to adapt. NIST CSF doesn't cover LLMs. ISO 27001 doesn't address training data. This is where you get AI-specific compliance mapping built for the work you actually have to do.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"SMB Operators\",{\"className\":\"relative bg-navy rounded-xl p-8 overflow-hidden hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-teal/10 transition-shadow\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-1 bg-teal opacity-60\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-4xl mb-4\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":\"🏢\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"font-display text-teal-lt text-lg font-bold mb-3\",\"children\":\"SMB Operators\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"You're using Copilot, ChatGPT, and half a dozen other AI tools across your team. Nobody approved them. Nobody audited them. Nobody knows what data they're ingesting. That's not a technology problem — it's a liability problem. Let's fix it.\"}]]}]]}]]}]}]\nc:[\"$\",\"$L16\",null,{\"headline\":\"Start Here: Free AI Security Risk Overview\",\"subhead\":\"Know exactly where your risks are. Zero cost. No sales call required. Used by 500+ security professionals to brief SMB leadership.\"}]\nd:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-light-bg py-20 px-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"max-w-7xl mx-auto\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-center mb-12\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"section-label mb-3\",\"children\":\"// AUDIT SERVICE\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"font-display text-navy text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4\",\"children\":\"Professional AI Security Audit Reports\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-mid-gray text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto\",\"children\":\"A clear picture of your AI risk, delivered in 5 business day